  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the Danish-Arab Partnership Programme.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation undertook a comprehensive assessment of the whole Danish-Arab Partnership Programme throughout its duration (2003-14) with a main emphasis on the 2009-2014 period. The overall purpose of the evaluation was to i) Document achievements and results across thematic areas as well as focus countries; ii) assess whether strategic objectives and thematic areas continue to be relevant given the dynamic, rapidly changing and fragile context of the MENA-region; and iii) provide lessons learned and recommendations for preparing a new strategy for DAPP (2017-21).</narrative>
  </description>
